; browsers/engine: a page's boxes, their shapes, and a page read (the
; author's mini-chrome's src/layout, src/display, src/www and src/url,
; its first version; README.md), in folders as there (one library,
; ix_browser_engine):
;   layout/   a page's tree as boxes with a place and a size:
;             Box_layout (CSS's boxes), Flex_layout, Grid_layout,
;             Table_layout; Html_layout (the lines and fragments they
;             end in), Hit (what is under a point)
;   display/  the boxes as the playground's shapes: Style (a letter's
;             look), Stroke_text and Glyph_unicode (the letters, by
;             Hershey's pen), Browser_text (a word's width),
;             Browser_draw, Browser_boxes, Browser_picture
;   page/     Browser_page (a page read, laid out and drawn),
;             Browser_forms, Browser_url, Browser_history
; tests/ has its own stanzas and is not of the folders.
(include_subdirs unqualified)

